{"id":"mirada","lemma":"mirada","pos":"noun","rank":1150,"glosses":["look, glance"],"ipa":"/miˈɾada/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"miradas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ed/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-mirada.wav","examples":[{"text":"Su mirada expresaba su alegría.","en":"Her look expressed her joy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639618","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"to express","l":"expresar"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"joy, happiness"}]},{"text":"Ella tenía conocimiento de su mirada.","en":"She was aware of his eyes.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"knowledge"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Su mirada te dice que te ama.","en":"Her look says that she loves you.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"lady of the house"}]},{"text":"Las miradas se cruzaron.","en":"Their eyes met.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441082","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to cross","l":"cruzar"}]},{"text":"Una mirada contenta apareció en su rostro.","en":"A look of contentment appeared on his face.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"content","l":"contento"},{"g":"to appear","l":"aparecer"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"face"}]}]}